From 37e396734ac23c1ba2d6c40dfec7e0ce11973022 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Destrudos6 <3411622425@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:56:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 12/51] Add a bisub debug log with in-app viewer and failure
 dumps

Every pipeline stage now records into a 2000-entry in-memory ring
buffer mirrored to logcat under one tag (adb logcat -s Bisub):
cache target resolution and track picking, per-chunk engine requests
with line/char counts, HTTP status codes with elapsed time and error
body excerpts, batch retries with stack traces, and cache writes.
The settings screen gains a Debug category with a viewer dialog
(monospace, copy/clear), and every failed translation dumps the whole
buffer to bisub/logs/last-failure.txt so the evidence survives later
activity.
